      "machineHash": "debe1fd62ab165df2e468400fbfcf5fc604d7a73ee7dbad656b382f370adb3e0",
      "machineText": "但這不代表您只能選擇這些框架。Wails 應用程式的前端*就只是一個 Web 專案*——任何能建置為靜態 HTML/CSS/JS 的框架都能使用。如果您選擇的框架（Solid、Preact、Lit、Qwik、SvelteKit、Angular……）沒有範本，只要幾分鐘就能自行建立初始專案。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "That doesn't mean those are your only options. The frontend of a Wails app is *just a\\ web project* …",
